Stream Connect for Apache Kafka 
Stream Connect for Apache Kafka allows customers to connect their Kafka environment to their ServiceNow 
instance enabling data to be streamed between the instance and external systems.  Producers send data from the 
instance to the Kafka environment.  Consumers retrieve data from the Kafka environment into the instance.  
Between the instance and the customer’s Kafka environment, data flows through a messaging queue hosted on 
dedicated infrastructure.  
  
