Access Requests and Access Revocation 
SailPoint is used to automate the provisioning and deprovisioning of access to key systems within the production 
environment to include LDAP (which is the authentication mechanism used in infrastructure authentication), Now 
Support, Datacenter, and AD.  Birth right access is auto provisioned by SailPoint upon hire, and managers request 
additional role / group access within the onboarding ticket. 
  
Ongoing access requests are documented in a request ticket and elevated privilege requests are required to be 
approved by appropriate personnel (management or their designate).  
  
To help ensure access privileges are appropriate, the Identity and Access Management team completes an audit 
of user accounts on a quarterly basis to verify access to high-risk systems remains commensurate with job 
responsibilities.  If any individual is identified to have inappropriate access, it is immediately remediated. 
  
